  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies a frequency band for Wi-Fi channel queries.</summary>
    <remarks>Use this enum with <see cref="M:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiManager.GetAllowedChannels(Android.Net.Wifi.WifiBand,Android.Net.Wifi.WifiAvailableChannelModes)" /> and <see cref="M:Android.Net.Wifi.WifiManager.GetUsableChannels(Android.Net.Wifi.WifiBand,Android.Net.Wifi.WifiAvailableChannelModes)" />. Its band codes differ from the hotspot configuration codes in <see cref="T:Android.Net.Wifi.SoftApConfigurationBand" />.</remarks>
  </Docs>
